	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r07r0101_hakase2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アララギ『その　しあわせタマゴを
ポケモンに　もたせておくと▼
たたかいで　もらえる
けいけんちが　ちょっぴり　ふえるの！▼
ポケモンも　たくましい　ほうが
ずかんの　ページは　うめやすいよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T03:47:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T09:03:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アララギ『その　しあわせタマゴを
ポケモンに　持たせておくと▼
戦いで　もらえる
経験値が　ちょっぴり　増えるの！▼
ポケモンも　たくましい　方が
図鑑の　ページは　埋めやすいよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T03:47:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T09:03:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・c06ジムバッジ取得前
・アイテム入手後
・続けてhakase2_03
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T03:03:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>アララギ博士（娘）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T09:02:40" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T08:01:44" />
		</AttributeCell>
